#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:2
msgid "Files, Git, Terminal, Browser, and Computer Use"
msgstr "文件、Git、终端、浏览器和 Computer use"

#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Studio includes practical tools around the agent. You can use them "
"yourself, or let the agent request them inside a session."
msgstr "Studio 在 agent 周围提供了一组实用工具。你可以自己使用它们，也可以让 agent 在会话中请求使用。"

#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:17
msgid "The important distinction is simple:"
msgstr "重要区别很简单："

#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:19
msgid "a **read** operation tells you what is already there;"
msgstr "**read** 操作告诉你当前已有的内容；"

#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:20
msgid "a **propose** operation shows what a write would do;"
msgstr "**propose** 操作展示写入将会做什么；"

#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:21
msgid "a **write** operation changes the project;"
msgstr "**write** 操作会修改项目；"

#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:22
msgid "a **verify** operation checks the result."
msgstr "**verify** 操作会检查结果。"

#: ../../source/tools/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"The approval mode and tool policy decide which operations pause for your "
"permission. You should still review the target and the result."
msgstr "审批模式和工具策略决定哪些操作需要暂停并等待你的许可。你仍应审查目标和结果。"
